{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11114130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11114130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1111413001:0":{"text":"Looks like stuff from the Adamant Syndicate,","source_cn":"像是黑金商会的东西，","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387C307BFB9B40FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111413002:0":{"text":"Even though the Claws rounded up a bunch of folks to do their bidding, some of them couldn't escape the spiders' venomous fangs.","source_cn":"虽然抓了一群人替自己干活，但还是有些倒霉的家伙，最终没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11E82954B072CBFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111413003:0":{"text":"Looks like the Adamant Syndicate also managed to trick the Quicksand Claws to get in.","source_cn":"这么说来，流沙之爪也被黑金商会摆了一道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61CB1A3CDECF2517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111413004:0":{"text":"Ferranc thought he was digging for treasure when, in reality, he was just digging a tunnel to avoid the spider nest.","source_cn":"弗兰克还以为要挖宝藏，没想到只是为了绕开蜘蛛巢穴而挖地道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E349840D6F9F7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111413005:0":{"text":"For once, I'm starting to feel bad about his death.","source_cn":"我第一次为他的死而遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80386CEBA395FE58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111413006:0":{"text":"Huh? Why's that?","source_cn":"啊？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F5804CF7E4BD039","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111413007:0":{"text":"Because I didn't get a chance to see the look on his face when he dug up a bunch of the spider sacs.","source_cn":"我很好奇他挖出一堆蜘蛛卵时，脸上是什么表情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED52EE4FE19737EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111413008:0":{"text":"Oh... When you put it that way, I kind of wish I could've seen it too.","source_cn":"嗯……你这么一说，我也有点好奇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA6BED1D8084F9FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}